      "id": "claim_0576fae5d10b4f34814b88676d5e8c4c",
      "statement": "DiskManager enforces configurable durability via DurabilityMode (Lazy default, RangeAsync, Strict, LegacyWholeMmapAsync): sync_mutation_ranges issues msync(MS_ASYNC) for RangeAsync, msync(MS_SYNC) for Strict on each mutation, while Lazy issues no per-mutation flush and relies on explicit flush, Drop, or OS writeback for persistence.",
