      "id": "claim_30dffe7d0738443c95318d9b0e2821dc",
      "statement": "DiskManager::read_data_internal gathers physical blocks across direct, single-indirect, double-indirect, and triple-indirect tiers using 64-bit word pointer resolution, followed by a reverse pipeline of XChaCha20-Poly1305 decryption, Zstd decompression, and pre-compression filter unapplication.",
